{"4744400":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Verdant Requiem","steam_appid":4744400,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >＊Some parts of the game currently display both Japanese and English. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This may be improved in future updates, but for now, please consider it part of the current specifications.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >＊The game currently does **not support Steam Input**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your controller does not function correctly, please try the following:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Right-click *Verdant Requiem* in your Steam Library.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Select **Properties \/ Controller**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Set **Steam Input** to **Disabled**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could check whether the gamepad works again after changing this setting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>SRPG in Search of Balance<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a continent where the ideals of three nations clash, what will you choose, and what will you defend?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/7c3e49b23b06e650e5e0760c74d5ce82.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1275 height=954 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Verdant Requiem<\/u><\/strong> is a story-driven tactical RPG that combines classic strategic gameplay with a sweeping war chronicle, branching storylines, and original military management systems.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a simple tale of good versus evil.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources, faith, military power, and national interests all shape the conflicts of this world. As the ideals—and contradictions—of each nation clash, Leonis and his companions are drawn into a struggle over the balance of the entire continent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of future awaits this land will depend on the choices you make.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u># A Full-Length, Story-Driven SRPG<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Verdant Requiem* is designed as a full-length tactical RPG, with <strong>over 40 hours of total gameplay including the main story and optional scenarios.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story branches into multiple routes, with each route expected to take approximately **12–17 hours** to complete.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Estimated without using auto-battle, speed-up, or skip functions.*<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/7c2c296a5017ecca10a68c835515cd9d.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1272 height=949 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/347a742fea2b4d71c41b61c772b969e0.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1275 height=956 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the path you choose, the nations explored in the story, the meaning behind certain maps, the positions of your allies, and ultimately the ending itself will change.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main story, the game features optional scenarios and flashback events told from the perspectives of individual characters, adding an ensemble-drama element to the narrative.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no permanent character death, but defeated units may suffer injury penalties.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than permanently losing a character, the consequences of battle remain with your army in other ways, aiming to preserve tactical tension without sacrificing accessibility.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Verdant Requiem* is not a conventional fantasy story built around a simple conflict between good and evil.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it tells a war chronicle shaped by competing ideals, political schemes, and the circumstances of three nations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the story lies the balance between those three powers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One nation is blessed with abundant resources.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another is shaped by faith.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third thrives through trade and scholarship.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >None of their circumstances are simple, and even those who stand against you have reasons they cannot abandon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story primarily follows Leonis, but optional scenarios and flashback events also place the spotlight on his companions and people from across the three nations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid spreading characterization too thin, the number of playable allies is intentionally somewhat smaller than in many traditional SRPGs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return, the game places greater emphasis on each character's background, position within the world, relationships, and personal story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support conversations also feature character voice acting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Classic Tactical SRPG Combat<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/03b00b334f9689c1285aafc19213a221.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1272 height=951 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/c738346b5be04b4e8e0bbb40920b16f0.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1277 height=961 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in *Verdant Requiem* is built around the fundamentals of classic tactical RPGs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to familiar mechanics such as the weapon triangle, critical hits, effective damage, and skills, the game features a **flanking follow-up system** based on unit positioning, as well as **Combat Arts** that emphasize the individual strengths of each character.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is not simply about defeating enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you position your units, who initiates an attack, and when you choose to use a Combat Art can all change the course of battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to deliver the kind of deliberate, position-focused tactical gameplay that defines the SRPG genre.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A Strong Focus on Presentation<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/6dfe3a920df5516a81f6c2549e3aeb06.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/6dfe3a920df5516a81f6c2549e3aeb06.webp?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=1146 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/f227b7316b85ad47d966ac0cc9e5f608.poster.avif?t=1793737578\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/f227b7316b85ad47d966ac0cc9e5f608.webm?t=1793737578\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/f227b7316b85ad47d966ac0cc9e5f608.mp4?t=1793737578\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/8d0375314f166047e2555aa29a456f6a.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/8d0375314f166047e2555aa29a456f6a.webp?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=1171 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/656e2bd93781b2d94be599a0b835468b.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/656e2bd93781b2d94be599a0b835468b.webp?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=903 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considerable effort has also gone into presentation, with the goal of making both the story and battles feel more memorable.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat features character cut-ins and dedicated Combat Art effects, while event scenes make use of weather, fog, lighting, camera effects, and other visual techniques to establish the atmosphere of each scene.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also incorporates simulated bloom, water reflections, noise effects, and other visual processing techniques.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although *Verdant Requiem* is developed in SRPG Studio, extensive work has gone into creating a visual identity that goes beyond the engine's default appearance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character portraits blink, map sprites feature additional animations, and both modified and original pixel art assets are used throughout the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The UI in particular includes custom visual processing intended to connect the game's presentation with one of its central themes: **balance**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim is to create an experience in which the systems, presentation, and world itself feel connected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/1dc137cff4eee6c8f75b794c2b781840.poster.avif?t=1793737578\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/1dc137cff4eee6c8f75b794c2b781840.webm?t=1793737578\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/1dc137cff4eee6c8f75b794c2b781840.mp4?t=1793737578\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unique Systems<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/299ec9ffa2dc4a3d4b317d1cd1dd76fe.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/299ec9ffa2dc4a3d4b317d1cd1dd76fe.webp?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=1171 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to standard tactical maps, *Verdant Requiem* features several original systems focused on managing and maintaining your army.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two of the most important are:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Military Logistics**  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage three key resources: **Salt, Food, and Minerals**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Alignment Balance**  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leonis' alignment changes according to the player's actions, influencing both his abilities and the strength of the army as a whole.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other facilities and systems also support your forces outside of battle, including a **Mobile Canteen** and **Arcane Mineral Research Laboratory**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning battles is only one part of leading an army.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must also decide how to use limited supplies, how to sustain your forces, and what direction your army should ultimately take.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those decisions form an important part of the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/f1b86631263796f88088afd0210e541e.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1280 height=964 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/1a755745a519db6527f8974317d9326e.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1268 height=957 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/6f99253d9a979d3e2d55593f97f3865d.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1268 height=865 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the game features over **40,000 Japanese characters of Support Conversations**, with character voice acting included.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The **Tea Time** interaction system is unvoiced, but contains more than **50,000 Japanese characters of dialogue**. Presented from the player's point of view, it allows you to spend time with individual characters and talk with them about a wide variety of topics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through these conversations, you can discover more about each character's personality, values, relationships, and even sides of them that may never appear on the battlefield.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>A Heavier Tactical Experience with Resource Management<\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Verdant Requiem* is not designed as a simple SRPG in which you move directly from one battle map to the next.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Military Logistics system revolves around three resources:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Salt<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Food<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Minerals<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These resources are not only part of the army's logistical needs, but can also be used through various base facilities and systems.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leonis' alignment also changes according to the player's actions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These changes affect Leonis himself, allied units, and the army as a whole—and can even influence major branches in the story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this reason, players looking for a light and straightforward SRPG may find the game heavier than expected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other hand, players who enjoy taking their time with **story, tactics, army management, and resource management** may find the experience especially rewarding.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Recommended For Players Who Enjoy:<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Tactical RPGs \/ SRPGs<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Story-driven games and military fantasy<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Political intrigue and conflicts between competing ideals<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Following character backgrounds and relationships in depth<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Classic tactical RPG combat<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Resource management and military logistics<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- SRPG Studio games with extensive custom visuals, presentation, and systems<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will affect not only the journey of Leonis and his companions, but the future of the entire continent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you preserve the balance?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or will you break it?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices will determine the fate of this land.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>【Demo Save Data Transfer】<\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that transferred demo data is not officially supported for certain features, such as achievements. If you would still like to carry over your save data, please follow the instructions in the image below.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/949239c4dbd48954ce39fbc3be6aa35d.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1536 height=1024 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>【Playthroughs and Clear Points (CP)】<\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/528ebd92b54d0493af0f607821464d63.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1122 height=1402 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New Game Cycles and Clear Points (CP)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game features **three story routes**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The route branch occurs in **Chapter 10**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clearing each route awards **Clear Points (CP)**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP rewards are as follows:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clearing the **Empire Route**: 10 CP<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clearing the **Holy Nation Route**: 10 CP<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clearing the **Third Route**: 20 CP<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP can be used when selecting **New Game** to exchange for bonus items.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once CP has been awarded, spent points are restored the next time you begin a new game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 CP owned → 6 CP spent → Start another New Game → CP returns to 10.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that after clearing the Third Route and obtaining 20 CP, viewing the ending of either the Empire Route or Holy Nation Route will cause the stored CP value to return to 10.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewing the Third Route ending again will restore it to 20.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this reason, we recommend keeping a save file from **Chapter 25 immediately before clearing the Third Route**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Back up<\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to the instructions below regarding backups.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/9ee9422c774962d5b93265d2c85b5cf4.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/9ee9422c774962d5b93265d2c85b5cf4.avif?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important Notes<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game was created with the assistance of AI tools. Please refer to the relevant disclosure and rating information for details.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC shown or referenced within the game is **not included with the Steam version** and must be purchased separately. Please refer to the Steam community board for details.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game uses plugins that are currently **not compatible with Steam Deck**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming and Other Activities<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming, gameplay videos, monetized videos, archived streams, clips, and similar content are permitted.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please observe the following guidelines:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- For major story spoilers, please consider warning viewers in the title or description.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Harassment or abusive content directed at viewers, the game, or anyone involved in its development is prohibited.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Content must comply with generally accepted standards of public decency.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If possible, we would appreciate it if you let the developer know when you create or stream content featuring the game.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Version<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version is currently available on BOOTH.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Please note that compatibility with the Steam version’s save data, especially achievements, is not guaranteed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >＊Some parts of the game currently display both Japanese and English. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This may be improved in future updates, but for now, please consider it part of the current specifications.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >＊The game currently does **not support Steam Input**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your controller does not function correctly, please try the following:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Right-click *Verdant Requiem* in your Steam Library.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Select **Properties \/ Controller**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Set **Steam Input** to **Disabled**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could check whether the gamepad works again after changing this setting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>SRPG in Search of Balance<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a continent where the ideals of three nations clash, what will you choose, and what will you defend?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/7c3e49b23b06e650e5e0760c74d5ce82.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1275 height=954 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Verdant Requiem<\/u><\/strong> is a story-driven tactical RPG that combines classic strategic gameplay with a sweeping war chronicle, branching storylines, and original military management systems.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a simple tale of good versus evil.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources, faith, military power, and national interests all shape the conflicts of this world. As the ideals—and contradictions—of each nation clash, Leonis and his companions are drawn into a struggle over the balance of the entire continent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of future awaits this land will depend on the choices you make.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u># A Full-Length, Story-Driven SRPG<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Verdant Requiem* is designed as a full-length tactical RPG, with <strong>over 40 hours of total gameplay including the main story and optional scenarios.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story branches into multiple routes, with each route expected to take approximately **12–17 hours** to complete.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Estimated without using auto-battle, speed-up, or skip functions.*<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/7c2c296a5017ecca10a68c835515cd9d.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1272 height=949 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/347a742fea2b4d71c41b61c772b969e0.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1275 height=956 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the path you choose, the nations explored in the story, the meaning behind certain maps, the positions of your allies, and ultimately the ending itself will change.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main story, the game features optional scenarios and flashback events told from the perspectives of individual characters, adding an ensemble-drama element to the narrative.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no permanent character death, but defeated units may suffer injury penalties.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than permanently losing a character, the consequences of battle remain with your army in other ways, aiming to preserve tactical tension without sacrificing accessibility.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Verdant Requiem* is not a conventional fantasy story built around a simple conflict between good and evil.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it tells a war chronicle shaped by competing ideals, political schemes, and the circumstances of three nations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the story lies the balance between those three powers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One nation is blessed with abundant resources.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another is shaped by faith.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third thrives through trade and scholarship.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >None of their circumstances are simple, and even those who stand against you have reasons they cannot abandon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story primarily follows Leonis, but optional scenarios and flashback events also place the spotlight on his companions and people from across the three nations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid spreading characterization too thin, the number of playable allies is intentionally somewhat smaller than in many traditional SRPGs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return, the game places greater emphasis on each character's background, position within the world, relationships, and personal story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support conversations also feature character voice acting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Classic Tactical SRPG Combat<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/03b00b334f9689c1285aafc19213a221.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1272 height=951 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/c738346b5be04b4e8e0bbb40920b16f0.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1277 height=961 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in *Verdant Requiem* is built around the fundamentals of classic tactical RPGs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to familiar mechanics such as the weapon triangle, critical hits, effective damage, and skills, the game features a **flanking follow-up system** based on unit positioning, as well as **Combat Arts** that emphasize the individual strengths of each character.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is not simply about defeating enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you position your units, who initiates an attack, and when you choose to use a Combat Art can all change the course of battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to deliver the kind of deliberate, position-focused tactical gameplay that defines the SRPG genre.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A Strong Focus on Presentation<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/6dfe3a920df5516a81f6c2549e3aeb06.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/6dfe3a920df5516a81f6c2549e3aeb06.webp?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=1146 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/f227b7316b85ad47d966ac0cc9e5f608.poster.avif?t=1793737578\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/f227b7316b85ad47d966ac0cc9e5f608.webm?t=1793737578\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/f227b7316b85ad47d966ac0cc9e5f608.mp4?t=1793737578\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/8d0375314f166047e2555aa29a456f6a.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/8d0375314f166047e2555aa29a456f6a.webp?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=1171 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/656e2bd93781b2d94be599a0b835468b.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/656e2bd93781b2d94be599a0b835468b.webp?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=903 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considerable effort has also gone into presentation, with the goal of making both the story and battles feel more memorable.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat features character cut-ins and dedicated Combat Art effects, while event scenes make use of weather, fog, lighting, camera effects, and other visual techniques to establish the atmosphere of each scene.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also incorporates simulated bloom, water reflections, noise effects, and other visual processing techniques.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although *Verdant Requiem* is developed in SRPG Studio, extensive work has gone into creating a visual identity that goes beyond the engine's default appearance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character portraits blink, map sprites feature additional animations, and both modified and original pixel art assets are used throughout the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The UI in particular includes custom visual processing intended to connect the game's presentation with one of its central themes: **balance**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim is to create an experience in which the systems, presentation, and world itself feel connected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/1dc137cff4eee6c8f75b794c2b781840.poster.avif?t=1793737578\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/1dc137cff4eee6c8f75b794c2b781840.webm?t=1793737578\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/1dc137cff4eee6c8f75b794c2b781840.mp4?t=1793737578\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unique Systems<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/299ec9ffa2dc4a3d4b317d1cd1dd76fe.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/299ec9ffa2dc4a3d4b317d1cd1dd76fe.webp?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=1171 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to standard tactical maps, *Verdant Requiem* features several original systems focused on managing and maintaining your army.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two of the most important are:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Military Logistics**  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage three key resources: **Salt, Food, and Minerals**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Alignment Balance**  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leonis' alignment changes according to the player's actions, influencing both his abilities and the strength of the army as a whole.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other facilities and systems also support your forces outside of battle, including a **Mobile Canteen** and **Arcane Mineral Research Laboratory**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning battles is only one part of leading an army.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must also decide how to use limited supplies, how to sustain your forces, and what direction your army should ultimately take.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those decisions form an important part of the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/f1b86631263796f88088afd0210e541e.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1280 height=964 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/1a755745a519db6527f8974317d9326e.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1268 height=957 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/6f99253d9a979d3e2d55593f97f3865d.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1268 height=865 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the game features over **40,000 Japanese characters of Support Conversations**, with character voice acting included.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The **Tea Time** interaction system is unvoiced, but contains more than **50,000 Japanese characters of dialogue**. Presented from the player's point of view, it allows you to spend time with individual characters and talk with them about a wide variety of topics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through these conversations, you can discover more about each character's personality, values, relationships, and even sides of them that may never appear on the battlefield.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>A Heavier Tactical Experience with Resource Management<\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Verdant Requiem* is not designed as a simple SRPG in which you move directly from one battle map to the next.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Military Logistics system revolves around three resources:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Salt<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Food<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Minerals<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These resources are not only part of the army's logistical needs, but can also be used through various base facilities and systems.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leonis' alignment also changes according to the player's actions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These changes affect Leonis himself, allied units, and the army as a whole—and can even influence major branches in the story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this reason, players looking for a light and straightforward SRPG may find the game heavier than expected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other hand, players who enjoy taking their time with **story, tactics, army management, and resource management** may find the experience especially rewarding.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Recommended For Players Who Enjoy:<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Tactical RPGs \/ SRPGs<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Story-driven games and military fantasy<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Political intrigue and conflicts between competing ideals<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Following character backgrounds and relationships in depth<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Classic tactical RPG combat<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Resource management and military logistics<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- SRPG Studio games with extensive custom visuals, presentation, and systems<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will affect not only the journey of Leonis and his companions, but the future of the entire continent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you preserve the balance?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or will you break it?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices will determine the fate of this land.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>【Demo Save Data Transfer】<\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that transferred demo data is not officially supported for certain features, such as achievements. If you would still like to carry over your save data, please follow the instructions in the image below.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/949239c4dbd48954ce39fbc3be6aa35d.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1536 height=1024 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>【Playthroughs and Clear Points (CP)】<\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/528ebd92b54d0493af0f607821464d63.avif?t=1793737578\" width=1122 height=1402 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New Game Cycles and Clear Points (CP)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game features **three story routes**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The route branch occurs in **Chapter 10**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clearing each route awards **Clear Points (CP)**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP rewards are as follows:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clearing the **Empire Route**: 10 CP<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clearing the **Holy Nation Route**: 10 CP<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clearing the **Third Route**: 20 CP<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP can be used when selecting **New Game** to exchange for bonus items.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once CP has been awarded, spent points are restored the next time you begin a new game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 CP owned → 6 CP spent → Start another New Game → CP returns to 10.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that after clearing the Third Route and obtaining 20 CP, viewing the ending of either the Empire Route or Holy Nation Route will cause the stored CP value to return to 10.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewing the Third Route ending again will restore it to 20.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this reason, we recommend keeping a save file from **Chapter 25 immediately before clearing the Third Route**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Back up<\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to the instructions below regarding backups.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras\/9ee9422c774962d5b93265d2c85b5cf4.avif?t=1793737578\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/extras_big\/9ee9422c774962d5b93265d2c85b5cf4.avif?t=1793737578 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important Notes<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game was created with the assistance of AI tools. Please refer to the relevant disclosure and rating information for details.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC shown or referenced within the game is **not included with the Steam version** and must be purchased separately. Please refer to the Steam community board for details.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game uses plugins that are currently **not compatible with Steam Deck**.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming and Other Activities<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming, gameplay videos, monetized videos, archived streams, clips, and similar content are permitted.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please observe the following guidelines:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- For major story spoilers, please consider warning viewers in the title or description.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Harassment or abusive content directed at viewers, the game, or anyone involved in its development is prohibited.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Content must comply with generally accepted standards of public decency.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If possible, we would appreciate it if you let the developer know when you create or stream content featuring the game.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Version<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version is currently available on BOOTH.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Please note that compatibility with the Steam version’s save data, especially achievements, is not guaranteed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"“SRPG in Search of Balance&quot; On a continent where three nations’ ideals clash, what will you choose, and what will you protect? Verdant Requiem is a SRPG about a war for balance beyond good and evil, featuring detailed 2D maps, branching storylines, resource management, and elemental balance.","supported_languages":"Japanese, English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/c703ddd4073c75e44996d161789d3a7676999371\/header.jpg?t=1793737578","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/1696c2760d26b09666b66ee309ad9b9055a7462b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793737578","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4744400\/1696c2760d26b09666b66ee309ad9b9055a7462b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793737578","website":"https:\/\/medym4.wixsite.com\/verdant-requiem","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong>  Microsoft® Windows® Vista(sp2) \/ 7 \/ 8 \/ 10 (32bit\/64bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Pentium® 4 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 512 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> 1024 x 768 pixels or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1.2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Med.y.m"],"publishers":["Med.y.m"],"demos":[{"appid":4790190,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":799,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$9.99","final_formatted":"$7.99"},"packages":[1650256],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Verdant Requiem","description":"","selection_text":"